SUMMARY:FEED · history · HIS01-en
DESCRIPTION:Open enrollment\, then Black Friday rent-to-own and buy-now-pay
 -later\nInstagram\, Facebook\, Threads\, LinkedIn (short version: X\, Blue
 sky)\n\nTHE FREEDMAN'S SAVINGS BANK · 1865–1874\n\nCongress chartered a
  bank for the formerly enslaved\, and tens of thousands opened accounts. I
 ts white trustees moved the deposits into risky loans and speculation. Whe
 n it failed in 1874\, many families lost savings they had worked for since
  freedom.\n\nThe lesson: Always ask whose hands are on your money.\n\nEver
 y card in the game's History deck is true. getcivicarmor.com/play\n\n#Blac
 kHistory #ReadTheMachine #CivicArmor #TheSecondNumber
END:VEVENT
