SUMMARY:FEED · history · HIS02-en
DESCRIPTION:Open enrollment\, then Black Friday rent-to-own and buy-now-pay
 -later\nInstagram\, Facebook\, Threads\, LinkedIn (short version: X\, Blue
 sky)\n\nMAGGIE L. WALKER'S PENNY SAVINGS BANK · 1903\n\nMaggie Lena Walke
 r chartered the St. Luke Penny Savings Bank so Black families could save\,
  borrow and buy homes on fair terms. She was the first woman of any race t
 o charter a bank in the United States.\n\nThe lesson: If they won't lend t
 o you fairly\, build the bank.\n\nEvery card in the game's History deck is
  true. getcivicarmor.com/play\n\n#BlackHistory #ReadTheMachine #CivicArmor
  #TheSecondNumber
END:VEVENT
