 k families bought homes "on contract" at inflated prices\, losing everythi
 ng after one missed payment. They organized\, withheld payments together a
 nd went to court\, and forced many sellers to renegotiate.\n\nThe lesson: 
 Read the contract together. Then fight it together.\n\nEvery card in the g
 ame's History deck is true. getcivicarmor.com/play\n\n#BlackHistory #ReadT
 heMachine #CivicArmor #TheSecondNumber
